sode":3,"title":"Incoming Widow","overview":"A day in court doesn't go as planned, and Chloe goes somewhere surprising for emotional support.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kiWdwQJ9355cTjpKTuiB5VEzIrd.jpg","released":"2025-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"53 min"},{"id":"tt32260680:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Gazpacho","overview":"Catherine throws a memorial for Adam that no one wants to go to. Chloe and Nicky have very different memories of just about everything.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oezpha7cEQjriYyQXo50xYwLWPf.jpg","released":"2025-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt32260680:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Just Ask","overview":"Nicky tries to shake off a bad night. Chloe tries to figure out what Adam was up to when he died. And the trial is starting.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sJs8GyoD3nEwsyZynhdjdYq7yuy.jpg","released":"2025-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt32260680:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Steadying Hand","overview":"The sisters take the stand, but what truth will they tell? Guidry's temper flares.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/obzrtASityoTWF4zlnEZD95oGEk.jpg","released":"2025-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"62 min"},{"id":"tt32260680:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Back from Red","overview":"Adam's darkest secret finally comes out, and it changes everything for Chloe and Nicky. Guidry and Bowen go back to basics.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eee7fHhpW1LkeHXxZB5attVpAas.jpg","released":"2025-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt32260680:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"They're in Their World","overview":"Chloe enacts a plan, Guidry takes a trip, Nicky explains a few key details, and the sisters try to figure out if being in each other's lives is even possible.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1sSfKjuwhTOxRgioG6PiPRNtQJQ.jpg","released":"2025-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"62 min"}